<title>USA: Texaco Inc Q3 net rose.</title>
<headline>Texaco Inc Q3 net rose.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.61		    $1.06</p>
<p> Net			434,000		  290,000</p>
<p> Revs		  11,097,000		8,814,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 160,800		  260,100</p>
<p>		     Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr			  $5.62		    $3.13</p>
<p> Net		    1,509,000		  858,000</p>
<p> Revs		  32,629,000	     27,140,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 260,700		  259,900</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call consensus for Q3 was $1.46.</p>
<p>1995 net includes net gains of $2 million in quarter and $73 million in nine months.</p>
<p>1996 nine months net includes gain of $224 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
